From: Kreijstal <rainb@tfwno.gf>
Subject: [PATCH] vkd3d-shader/hlsl: Reject SampleCmp() before shader model 4.

Comparison sampling does not exist in shader model 1-3. fxc fails with
X4532 "cannot map expression to pixel shader instruction set"; vkd3d hit
vkd3d_unreachable() in get_vsir_resource_type() and crashed the process.
---
--- a/libs/vkd3d-shader/hlsl.y
+++ b/libs/vkd3d-shader/hlsl.y
@@ -6177,6 +6177,15 @@
     else
         load_params.type = HLSL_RESOURCE_SAMPLE_CMP;
 
+    /* There is no comparison sampling in shader model 1-3; fxc fails with
+     * "cannot map expression to pixel shader instruction set". */
+    if (hlsl_version_lt(ctx, 4, 0))
+    {
+        hlsl_error(ctx, loc, VKD3D_SHADER_ERROR_HLSL_INCOMPATIBLE_PROFILE,
+                "Method '%s' is not supported in shader model 1-3.", name);
+        return false;
+    }
+
     if (params->args_count < 3 || params->args_count > 5 + !!offset_dim)
     {
         hlsl_error(ctx, loc, VKD3D_SHADER_ERROR_HLSL_WRONG_PARAMETER_COUNT,
